<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A brief toast notification confirms that the chat copied something to your clipboard."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_copy}>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Confirmation")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "When you copy something with a Copy item in a chat context menu, a short Copied! message appears and then closes by itself."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_features", "When It Helps")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Copying to the clipboard happens out of sight. The toast tells you that the text is ready to paste, so you do not need to test it first."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Which Actions Show It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The toast appears after these items in the chat context menu:"
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Message, on a message")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Source, on a message that has formatting")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Nick, on a nickname")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy URL, on a link")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy Channel Name, on a channel name")}</li>
</ul>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Copy actions in the conversations list show the same toast. Share windows that offer a copy button show it as well."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The toast is a small window titled Info with an OK button. Click OK to close it at once."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "If you do nothing, it closes by itself after about two seconds."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "It appears only after the copy succeeds. If the browser blocks clipboard access, no toast appears."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Notes")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A copy made with the browser's own keyboard shortcut, or with Copy in the Edit menu, does not show this toast. The text is still copied."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-unread-indicators">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Unread Indicators")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-contextual-tips">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Contextual Tips")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
